# jextract symbol list for mpv.h (generate.sh): the client.h/render.h/render_gl.h symbols the Kotlin code uses
# (src/main/kotlin, src/libmpvTest). Add one here and regenerate before using it. mpv_client_api_version and
# MPV_CLIENT_API_VERSION stay out: C 'unsigned long', not portable to LLP64 Windows.
